Individual scopes for all metabolic networks available in results/m2m_iscope/indiv_scopes/indiv_scopes.json. The scopes have been filtered a way that if a seed is in a scope, it means the corresponding species is predicted to be able to produce it.

Information regarding the producibility of seeds, and the possible absence of seeds in some metabolic networks is stored in results/m2m_iscope/indiv_scopes/seeds_in_indiv_scopes.json.

15 metabolic models considered.

